# ── 2. Alternative Media Storage (Cloudinary — 100% Free, No Credit Card) ─────
# Sign up free at https://cloudinary.com (Free tier: 25GB/month bandwidth & storage)
# In Cloudinary Dashboard -> Settings -> Upload -> Upload Presets:
# Click "Add upload preset", set Signing Mode to "Unsigned", and name it (e.g. deckknob_uploads).
VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=YOUR_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME
VITE_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=YOUR_UNSIGNED_UPLOAD_PRESET

# ── 3. Legacy Backend API (Optional / Local Dev) ─────────────────────────────
